{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not make MDC snapshot failures terminal workflow failures.** An ordinary `MDC.getCopyOfContextMap()` failure is routed through `finishFailure`, producing durable `FAILED` before hooks or user code run. Treat capture as best-effort with a safe clearing baseline, or propagate it as a retryable invocation failure without emitting a terminal response.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77qqJL","finding_digest":"0133ad3d67132cc709d324b4bff21ae1d7ecb80233125efebfc5cabeb0237650","finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::mdc-capture-failure-classification","line":291,"observation_digest":"b7cee8d667d9e90e8d6af1807f33e7c10cbc683c25c1d14fc91f60fe671c788c","observation_id":"aro_v1_w7horvth3huq5dlk6gah6m7hye","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_aez22plhcmwmocotes2l74q24h","published_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_w4f4vfmlkvk6yuwzqbo6rmxwrf","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"6c590162ee0e40cbba600285b7fafbadc0457c8e","reviewer":"codex","start_line":290,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_252sshvdl5h64tz4sr3bh4go6b","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T17:41:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
